Package: cimc-studio
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: CIMC Studio Project <1579583959@qq.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libstdc++6, zlib1g, xdg-utils
Recommends: firefox | firefox-esr | chromium | chromium-browser
Homepage: https://github.com/Epiphany-Lucky/cimc-simulator
Description: Local embedded firmware simulation workbench
 Executes ARM HEX/BIN firmware with a functional GD32F470 V1 board model.
 Includes the Python runtime and Unicorn CPU engine. The graphical workbench
 opens in the user's default desktop browser; no physical COM port or board
 is needed. This package targets Ubuntu 22.04+ and Debian 12+ on amd64.
